extends /specs/page-structure/layout.jade

block content
    h1 Controller
    p This plugin is used to act as a middleware between interactive plugins/modules (such as slide / Drop block / figure viewer ... etc) to make sure they work together and there are no behavioural conflicts.

    section.source_section
        h2 Usage
        h3 include controller js file
        code.src-js.source_visible
            | import '../../plugins/controller/js/controller.js'
        markdown
            p Include `controller.js` in your js code to be able to use it.

        h3 Check() function
        code.src-js.source_visible
            | if (typeof(LIT.controller) != "undefined"){
            |   LIT.controller.check();
            | }
        markdown
            p Call `LIT.controller.check()` function in your `something.on.show()` and make sure to check if controller is defined before using it's functions.
    | #{''}